- an alternative to littlenavmap-bin which is more lightweight(-400% less disk space usage as some small performance gains. You'll notice less stutters when zooming in or out the map when there are lots of items enabled)
- qt6 support with docking on wayland too
- attemps to use system libraries, likewise it respects system theme
- the xplane plugin isn't provided. you'll have to build it yourself or use the stable release plugin version
- its bleeding edge so if you have any pkgbuild issues delete the src first
- if you get no tag found deepening its not problem just let it do it's thing. if it fails rereun the build
- only build issues should be reported here. use upstream to report application issues
- you can download and install the latest CI build at https://github.com/Denzy7/littlenavmap-git_PKGBUILD/actions
